  <LanguagePacks><LanguagePack ID="ENU" IsDefault="true"><DisplayStrings><DisplayString ElementID="HyperVPrivateCloud.Capability.Storage.HostParticipation"><Name>Hyper-V Host SAN Storage Participation</Name><Description>Present only on Hyper-V hosts with MPIO-claimed disks, iSCSI sessions, or Fibre Channel ports. Host-level SAN monitoring targets this object, so hosts with only local or Storage Spaces Direct storage are never evaluated.</Description></DisplayString><DisplayString ElementID="HyperVPrivateCloud.Capability.Storage.MultipathReport.Task"><Name>Show MPIO path report</Name><Description>mpclaim -s -d, DSM defaults and claim rules, MPIO settings and per-disk path counts.</Description></DisplayString><DisplayString ElementID="HyperVPrivateCloud.Capability.Storage.IscsiReport.Task"><Name>Show iSCSI initiator report</Name><Description>Initiator service, target portals, targets, sessions, connections and recent iScsiPrt errors.</Description></DisplayString><DisplayString ElementID="HyperVPrivateCloud.Capability.Storage.FibreChannelReport.Task"><Name>Show Fibre Channel port report</Name><Description>Initiator ports, HBA port attributes and statistics, adapter driver and firmware versions.</Description></DisplayString><DisplayString ElementID="HyperVPrivateCloud.Capability.Storage.LogicalUnitReport.Task"><Name>Show SAN disks and latency</Name><Description>SAN-attached disks with state, health and size plus current physical disk latency and queue counters.</Description></DisplayString><DisplayString ElementID="HyperVPrivateCloud.Capability.Storage.RescanStorage.Task"><Name>Remediation: Rescan storage</Name><Description>Update-HostStorageCache so newly presented LUNs and path changes are picked up.</Description></DisplayString><DisplayString ElementID="HyperVPrivateCloud.Capability.Storage.ReconnectIscsiTarget.Task"><Name>Remediation: Reconnect an iSCSI target</Name><Description>Connect-IscsiTarget -IsPersistent -IsMultipathEnabled. Parameter = target IQN.</Description></DisplayString><DisplayString ElementID="HyperVPrivateCloud.Capability.Storage.Task.WriteAction"><Name>Storage task runner</Name><Description>Runs the operator task script for this capability through PowerShell 7 on the agent and returns its text output.</Description></DisplayString>{{ELEMENT_DISPLAY_STRINGS}}{{STORAGE_DISPLAY_STRINGS}}
